SRDM BHUVAN YUKTDHARA SUB ENGINEER REPORT
=========================================

1. ZIP ko Extract All karein.
2. INSTALL_BHUVAN_SUBENGINEER_REPORT.bat par double-click karein.
3. Script dashboard folder C:\Users\welcome\Daily-labour-report-satna-maihar
   me report install, live Bhuvan data refresh aur GitHub publish karegi.
4. SUCCESS ke baad 1-3 minute rukkar srdmsatna.online par Ctrl+Shift+R karein.

Report features:
- All / Satna / Maihar District filter
- Janpad aur Sub Engineer filter
- Combined old SATNA block ko SOHAWAL naam se display
- Satna: Majhgawan, Nagod, Rampur Baghelan, Sohawal, Unchahara
- Maihar: Maihar, Amarpatan, Ramnagar
- Plan Started, Submitted, Not Started, GAS Approved
- Print/PDF aur Excel/CSV download
- Daily one-click updater me automatic refresh hook

IMPORTANT: Extract kiye bina ZIP ke andar se BAT na chalayein.
